# Title: JXA In-memory Execution Via OSAScript
# ID: f1408a58-0e94-4165-b80a-da9f96cf6fc3
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
# Date: 2023-01-31
# Tags: attack.t1059.002, attack.t1059.007, attack.execution
# Description: Detects possible malicious execution of JXA in-memory via OSAScript
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:* -l * AND process.command_line:*JavaScript*)) OR (process.command_line:*.js*)) AND ((process.command_line:*osascript* AND process.command_line:* -e * AND process.command_line:*eval* AND process.command_line:*NSData.dataWithContentsOfURL*)))
